#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:2
msgid "How to manually configure a Git repository integration"
msgstr "如何手动配置 Git 仓库集成"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:4
msgid ""
"In this guide, you will find the steps to manually integrate your Read the "
"Docs project with any Git provider using :term:`webhooks <webhook>`. Manual "
"integration is most useful for Git providers that we don't support with "
"automatic configuration. Automatic configuration is supported for "
"|git_providers_and|."
msgstr ""
"本指南讲解如何使用 :term:`webhooks <webhook>` 手动将 Read the Docs 项目与任意 Git "
"服务商集成。手动集成对我们无法自动配置的 Git 服务商最为有用。|git_providers_and| 支持自动配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:9
msgid ""
"Git repositories that are imported manually **do not** have the required "
"setup to send back a **commit status**. If you need this integration, you "
"have to :doc:`configure the repository automatically </reference/git-"
"integration>`."
msgstr ""
"手动导入的 Git 仓库**没有** 回传** 提交状态** 所需的配置。若需要此集成，必须 :doc:`自动配置仓库 </reference/git-"
"integration>` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:30
msgid "Manual integration setup"
msgstr "手动集成设置"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:32
msgid ""
"You need to configure your Git provider integration to call a webhook that "
"alerts Read the Docs of changes. Read the Docs will sync versions and build "
"your documentation whenever a Git commit happens."
msgstr ""
"你需要配置 Git 服务商集成，调用一个 Webhook 通知 Read the Docs 变更。每当发生 Git 提交时，Read the Docs "
"会同步版本并构建文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:37
msgid "GitHub"
msgstr "GitHub"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:39
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Webhooks` of your **GitHub repository**"
msgstr "前往你的 **GitHub 仓库** 的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Webhooks`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:40
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:69
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Add webhook`"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add webhook`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:41
msgid ""
"For **Payload URL**, use the URL of the integration on your **Read the Docs "
"project**, found on your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Integrations` page. You may need to prepend *https://* to the URL."
msgstr ""
"**Payload URL** 填写 **Read the Docs 项目** 上集成的 URL，可在项目的 "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations` 页面找到。你可能需要在 URL 前加上 *https://* 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:44
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:99
msgid ""
"For **Content type**, both *application/json* and *application/x-www-form-"
"urlencoded* work"
msgstr ""
"**Content type** 填写 *application/json* 或 *application/x-www-form-urlencoded*"
" 均可"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:46
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:73
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:101
msgid ""
"Fill the **Secret** field with the value from the integration on Read the "
"Docs"
msgstr "**Secret** 字段填写 Read the Docs 上集成对应的值"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:47
msgid ""
"Select **Let me select individual events**, and mark **Branch or tag "
"creation**, **Branch or tag deletion**, **Pull requests** and **Pushes** "
"events"
msgstr ""
"选择 **Let me select individual events** ，并勾选 **Branch or tag creation** "
"、**Branch or tag deletion** 、**Pull requests** 和 **Pushes** 事件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:49
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:104
msgid "Ensure **Active** is enabled; it is by default"
msgstr "确保 **Active** 已启用（默认即为启用）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:50
msgid ""
"Finish by clicking :guilabel:`Add webhook`.  You may be prompted to enter "
"your GitHub password to confirm your action."
msgstr "最后点击 :guilabel:`Add webhook` 。系统可能提示你输入 GitHub 密码以确认操作。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:52
msgid ""
"You can verify if the webhook is working at the bottom of the GitHub page "
"under **Recent Deliveries**. If you see a Response 200, then the webhook is "
"correctly configured. For a 403 error, it's likely that the Payload URL is "
"incorrect."
msgstr ""
"你可以在 GitHub 页面底部的 **Recent Deliveries** 中验证 Webhook 是否工作。若看到 Response 200，说明"
" Webhook 配置正确；若出现 403 错误，很可能是 Payload URL 有误。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:56
msgid "GitLab"
msgstr "GitLab"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:58
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Webhooks` of your **GitLab repository**"
msgstr "前往你的 **GitLab 仓库** 的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Webhooks`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:59
msgid ""
"For **URL**, use the URL of the integration on **Read the Docs project**, "
"found on your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations` page"
msgstr ""
"**URL** 填写 **Read the Docs 项目** 上集成的 URL，可在项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Integrations` 页面找到"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:61
msgid ""
"Fill the **Secret token** field with the value from the integration on Read "
"the Docs"
msgstr "**Secret token** 字段填写 Read the Docs 上集成对应的值"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:62
msgid ""
"Leave the default **Push events** selected, additionally mark **Tag push "
"events** and **Merge request events**."
msgstr "保留默认的 **Push events** ，另外勾选 **Tag push events** 和 **Merge request events** 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:64
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:105
msgid "Finish by clicking :guilabel:`Add Webhook`"
msgstr "最后点击 :guilabel:`Add Webhook`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:66
msgid "Bitbucket"
msgstr "Bitbucket"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:68
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Webhooks` of your **Bitbucket repository**"
msgstr "前往你的 **Bitbucket 仓库** 的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Webhooks`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:70
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:96
msgid ""
"For **URL**, use the URL of the integration on Read the Docs, found on your "
"project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations` page"
msgstr ""
"**URL** 填写 Read the Docs 上集成的 URL，可在项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> "
"Integrations` 页面找到"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:72
msgid "Under **Triggers**, **Repository push** should be selected"
msgstr "在 **Triggers** 下应选中 **Repository push**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:74
msgid "Finish by clicking :guilabel:`Save`"
msgstr "最后点击 :guilabel:`Save`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:76
msgid "Gitea"
msgstr "Gitea"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:78
msgid "These instructions apply to any Gitea instance."
msgstr "以下说明适用于任何 Gitea 实例。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:82
msgid ""
"This isn't officially supported, but using the \"GitHub webhook\" is an "
"effective workaround, because Gitea uses the same payload as GitHub. The "
"generic webhook is not compatible with Gitea. See `issue #8364`_ for more "
"details. Official support may be implemented in the future."
msgstr ""
"此方式未获官方支持，但使用\"GitHub webhook\"是有效的变通方案，因为 Gitea 使用与 GitHub 相同的载荷格式。通用 "
"Webhook 与 Gitea 不兼容。更多细节见 `issue #8364`_ 。未来可能实现官方支持。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:86
msgid "On Read the Docs:"
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:88
msgid ""
"Manually create a \"GitHub webhook\" integration (this will show a warning "
"about the webhook not being correctly set up, that will go away when the "
"webhook is configured in Gitea)"
msgstr ""
"手动创建一个\"GitHub webhook\"集成（此时会显示 Webhook 未正确设置的警告，在 Gitea 中配置好 Webhook "
"后警告会消失）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:92
msgid "On your Gitea instance:"
msgstr "在你的 Gitea 实例上："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:94
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Webhooks` of your **Gitea repository**"
msgstr "前往你的 **Gitea 仓库** 的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Webhooks`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:95
msgid "Create a new webhook of type \"Gitea\""
msgstr "创建类型为\"Gitea\"的新 Webhook"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:98
msgid "Leave the default **HTTP Method** as POST"
msgstr "保持默认的 **HTTP Method** 为 POST"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:102
msgid ""
"Select **Choose events**, and mark **Branch or tag creation**, **Branch or "
"tag deletion** and **Push** events"
msgstr ""
"选择 **Choose events** ，并勾选 **Branch or tag creation** 、**Branch or tag "
"deletion** 和 **Push** 事件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:106
msgid "Test the webhook with :guilabel:`Delivery test`"
msgstr "用 :guilabel:`Delivery test` 测试 Webhook"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:108
msgid ""
"Finally, on Read the Docs, check that the warnings have disappeared and the "
"delivery test triggered a build."
msgstr "最后在 Read the Docs 上检查警告是否已消失，且投递测试触发了构建。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:113
msgid "Others"
msgstr "其他"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:115
msgid ""
"Other providers are supported through a generic webhook, see :ref:`webhook-"
"integration-generic`."
msgstr "其他服务商通过通用 Webhook 支持，参见 :ref:`webhook-integration-generic` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:118
msgid "Payload validation"
msgstr "载荷验证"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:120
msgid ""
"All integrations are created with a secret token, this offers a way to "
"verify that a webhook request is legitimate."
msgstr "所有集成都使用密钥令牌创建，这提供了一种验证 Webhook 请求合法性的方式。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:123
msgid "This validation is done according to each provider:"
msgstr "各服务商的验证方式如下："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:125
msgid "`GitHub <https://developer.github.com/webhooks/securing/>`__"
msgstr "`GitHub <https://developer.github.com/webhooks/securing/>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:126
msgid ""
"`GitLab <https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/user/project/integrations/webhooks.html"
"#validate-payloads-by-using-a-secret-token>`__"
msgstr ""
"`GitLab <https://docs.gitlab.com/ee/user/project/integrations/webhooks.html"
"#validate-payloads-by-using-a-secret-token>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:127
msgid ""
"`Bitbucket <https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/manage-"
"webhooks/#Secure-webhooks>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Bitbucket <https://support.atlassian.com/bitbucket-cloud/docs/manage-"
"webhooks/#Secure-webhooks>`__"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:131
msgid "Managing Integrations"
msgstr "管理集成"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:133
msgid ""
"To manually set up an integration, go to your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations`, click on :guilabel:`Add "
"integration`, and select the integration type you'd like to add."
msgstr ""
"要手动设置集成，请前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations` ，点击 :guilabel:`Add"
" integration` ，并选择要添加的集成类型。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:136
msgid ""
"As an example, the URL pattern looks like this: "
"``https://app.readthedocs.org/api/v2/webhook/<project-name>/<id>/*``. Use "
"this URL when setting up a new integration with your provider."
msgstr ""
"举例来说，URL 格式形如：``https://app.readthedocs.org/api/v2/webhook/<project-"
"name>/<id>/*`` 。与服务商设置新集成时使用此 URL。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:142
msgid "Using the generic API integration"
msgstr "使用通用 API 集成"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:144
msgid ""
"For repositories that are not hosted with a supported provider, we also "
"offer a generic API endpoint for triggering project builds. Similar to "
"webhook integrations, this integration has a specific URL, which can be "
"found on the project's **Integrations** dashboard page "
"(:menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations`)."
msgstr ""
"对于托管在不受支持服务商上的仓库，我们还提供通用 API 端点用于触发项目构建。与 Webhook 集成类似，此集成有专属 URL，可在项目的 "
"**Integrations** 仪表盘页面（:menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations` ）找到。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:149
msgid ""
"Token authentication is required to use the generic endpoint, you will find "
"this token on the integration details page. The token should be passed in as"
" a request parameter, either as form data or as part of JSON data input."
msgstr "使用通用端点需要令牌认证，该令牌可在集成详情页找到。令牌应作为请求参数传入，可以是表单数据或 JSON 数据输入的一部分。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:154
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:156
msgid "This endpoint accepts the following arguments during an HTTP POST:"
msgstr "此端点在 HTTP POST 时接受以下参数："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:158
msgid "branches"
msgstr "branches"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:159
msgid ""
"The names of the branches to trigger builds for. This can either be an array"
" of branch name strings, or just a single branch name string."
msgstr "要触发构建的分支名称。可以是分支名字符串数组，也可以是单个分支名字符串。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:162
msgid "Default: **latest**"
msgstr "默认值：**latest**"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:164
msgid "token"
msgstr "token"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:165
msgid ""
"The integration token found on the project's **Integrations** dashboard page"
" (:menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations`)."
msgstr ""
"在项目 **Integrations** 仪表盘页面（:menuselection:`Settings --> Integrations` "
"）找到的集成令牌。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:169
msgid "default_branch"
msgstr "default_branch"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:170
msgid ""
"This is the default branch of the repository (ie. the one checked out when "
"cloning the repository without arguments)"
msgstr "仓库的默认分支（即克隆仓库时不带参数检出的分支）"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:173
msgid "*Optional*"
msgstr "*可选*"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:175
msgid ""
"For example, to build the ``dev`` branch of project ``example-project`` "
"using the integration token ``1234``:"
msgstr "例如，使用集成令牌 ``1234`` 构建项目 ``example-project`` 的 ``dev`` 分支："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:198
msgid ""
"A command like the one above could be called from a cron job or from a `Git "
"hook`_."
msgstr "类似上面的命令可以从 cron 作业或 `Git hook`_ 中调用。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:203
msgid "Authentication"
msgstr "认证"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:205
msgid ""
"This endpoint requires authentication. If authenticating with an integration"
" token, a check will determine if the token is valid and matches the given "
"project. If instead an authenticated user is used to make this request, a "
"check will be performed to ensure the authenticated user is an owner of the "
"project."
msgstr "此端点需要认证。若使用集成令牌认证，将检查令牌是否有效并与指定项目匹配；若使用已认证用户发起请求，则检查该用户是否为项目所有者。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:211
msgid "Troubleshooting Git provider webhooks"
msgstr "Git 服务商 Webhook 故障排查"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:214
msgid "Debugging webhooks"
msgstr "调试 Webhook"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:216
msgid ""
"If you are experiencing problems with an existing webhook, you may be able "
"to use the integration detail page to help debug the issue. Each project "
"integration, such as a webhook or the generic API endpoint, stores the HTTP "
"exchange that takes place between Read the Docs and the external source. "
"You'll find a list of these exchanges in any of the integration detail "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"若现有 Webhook 出现问题，可尝试用集成详情页辅助调试。每个项目集成（如 Webhook 或通用 API 端点）都会存储 Read the "
"Docs 与外部源之间发生的 HTTP 交换记录。在任意集成详情页都能找到这些交换的列表。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:223
msgid "Webhook activation failed. Make sure you have the necessary permissions"
msgstr "Webhook 激活失败。请确认你具备必要权限"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:225
msgid ""
"If you find this error, make sure your user has permissions over the "
"repository. In case of GitHub, check that you have granted access to the "
"Read the Docs `OAuth App`_ to your organization. A similar workflow is "
"required for other supported providers."
msgstr ""
"若遇到此错误，请确认你的用户对该仓库有权限。以 GitHub 为例，检查是否已向你的组织授予 Read the Docs `OAuth App`_ "
"访问权限。其他受支持服务商需要类似流程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:235
msgid "My project isn't automatically building"
msgstr "我的项目没有自动构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/setup/git-repo-manual.rst:237
msgid ""
"If your project isn't automatically building, you can check your integration"
" on Read the Docs to see the payload sent to our servers. If there is no "
"recent activity on your Read the Docs project webhook integration, then it's"
" likely that your Git provider is not configured correctly. If there is "
"payload information on your Read the Docs project, you might need to verify "
"that your versions are configured to build correctly."
msgstr ""
"若项目未自动构建，可查看 Read the Docs 上的集成以了解发送到我们服务器的载荷。若 Read the Docs 项目的 Webhook "
"集成没有近期活动，很可能是你的 Git 服务商配置有误。若项目上有载荷信息，你可能需要确认各版本已正确配置为可构建。"

